    "body": "I think we can just make it more rigorous with no problems by creating, e.g., a body element.\r\n\r\nLet's make it into a multi-line algorithm which:\r\n\r\n1. creates a new body element (see e.g. `#populate-with-html/head/body`). Add a `<p class=\"note\">` explaining this element is never exposed.\r\n2. Appends this.\r\n3. Returns the result of running...",
